    "detailed_description": "<strong>Relaxing Gameplay:</strong> Immerse yourself in a serene environment with soothing music and a calming atmosphere, perfect for unwinding.<br><strong>Easy Design Process:</strong> Enjoy a stress-free, flow interior design experience with straightforward mechanics, making it simple to create beautiful interiors.<br><strong>Cute Aesthetics:</strong> Delight in the adorable and whimsical art style, with rooms and furniture pieces designed to warm your heart.<br><strong>Progression:</strong> Pay attention to your clients' requests and preferences to keep them happy and earn higher ranks while collecting signature designer stamps.<br>Unlock Your Creativity: Balance client needs with your own design vision to discover a style that's uniquely you.",
